@startuml
title Niner Skills Quest - database-backed completed-course flow

actor Student
boundary "Course entry UI" as UI
control "CourseSelectionStore" as Store
control "Node.js API" as API
participant "Prisma ORM" as ORM
database "PostgreSQL database" as DB

Student -> UI: Select a supported course
UI -> Store: addCourse(courseId)
Store -> API: POST /api/courses/completed
API -> ORM: course.findUnique(courseId)
ORM -> DB: Find course
DB --> ORM: Course record or null
alt Unknown course
  ORM --> API: null
  API --> Store: 400 course does not exist
  Store --> UI: Set persistence message and notify
  UI --> Student: Show validation error
else Known course
  ORM --> API: Course record
  API -> ORM: studentCourse.create(studentId, courseId)
  ORM -> DB: Insert StudentCourse
  alt Duplicate selection
    DB --> ORM: Composite-key violation
    ORM --> API: P2002
    API --> Store: 409 course already selected
    Store --> UI: Set persistence message and notify
    UI --> Student: Show duplicate error
  else New selection
    DB --> ORM: Persisted selection
    API -> ORM: studentCourse.findMany with course skills
    ORM -> DB: Read saved courses and mappings
    DB --> ORM: Courses and mapped skills
    ORM --> API: Saved selections
    API --> Store: 201 selections
    Store --> UI: Update state and notify
    UI --> Student: Show saved course and skills
  end
end

Student -> UI: Restart the application
UI -> Store: Initialize and load selections
Store -> API: GET /api/courses/completed
API -> ORM: studentCourse.findMany with course skills
ORM -> DB: Read saved courses and mappings
DB --> ORM: Persisted courses and mapped skills
ORM --> API: Saved selections
API --> Store: 200 selections
Store --> UI: Restore state and notify
UI --> Student: Show saved course and skills

Student -> UI: Remove a course
UI -> Store: removeCourse(courseId)
Store -> API: DELETE /api/courses/completed/{courseId}
API -> ORM: studentCourse.delete(studentId, courseId)
ORM -> DB: Delete StudentCourse
DB --> ORM: Deletion confirmed
API -> ORM: studentCourse.findMany
ORM -> DB: Read remaining selections
DB --> ORM: Remaining courses and mappings
ORM --> API: Updated selections
API --> Store: 200 selections
Store --> UI: Update state and notify
UI --> Student: Show updated course list
@enduml
